---
// Two-layer cloud cap, built the same way as the hero's SectionDivider (variant="clouds"):
// each layer is a row of overlapping circles plus a rect that fills everything below the
// layer's band line.
//
// The shape of a bump depends on how deeply its circle is buried under that band line. A
// circle centered ON the line shows a full half-disc, and one centered ABOVE it shows more
// than half -- the silhouette then curves back inward between neighbours and reads as a row
// of bubbles. Both layers here instead use a large radius with the center well BELOW the
// band line (back: r 59-67, center 40 below; front: r 42-48, center 33 below), so only a
// shallow cap of each circle clears the line. That yields low, wide rolls (width:height
// roughly 4:1 to 5.8:1) that never pinch -- the cloud-like texture of the hero divider.
//
// Positions were generated once and hardcoded, so every card renders the identical pattern.
// Spacing is 0.62 * (visible half-width + previous visible half-width), rescaled so the first
// bump's visible left edge lands on x=0 and the last bump's visible right edge on x=368 --
// nothing is clipped at the sides, and every circle's top is well inside the cap.
//
// Colors: midColor (back) = --midnight-lavender-mid, matching the hero's own SectionDivider
// clouds instance. The front layer uses white instead of the hero's --midnight-lavender-pale
// so it blends seamlessly into the white card body it sits on.
---

<div class="cloud-cap" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg class="cloud-cap__svg" viewBox="0 0 368 74" width="100%" height="74" preserveAspectRatio="none">
    <g fill="var(--midnight-lavender)"><circle cx="47.4" cy="78" r="62"/><circle cx="95" cy="78" r="67"/><circle cx="140.7" cy="78" r="59"/><circle cx="185.3" cy="78" r="65"/><circle cx="231.1" cy="78" r="61"/><circle cx="277.5" cy="78" r="66"/><circle cx="323.3" cy="78" r="60"/><rect x="0" y="38" width="368" height="36"/></g>
    <g fill="var(--midnight-white)"><circle cx="29.1" cy="91" r="44"/><circle cx="69.9" cy="91" r="47"/><circle cx="108.6" cy="91" r="42"/><circle cx="146.5" cy="91" r="46"/><circle cx="185.3" cy="91" r="43"/><circle cx="226" cy="91" r="48"/><circle cx="265.6" cy="91" r="42"/><circle cx="302.5" cy="91" r="45"/><circle cx="340.4" cy="91" r="43"/><rect x="0" y="58" width="368" height="16"/></g>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .cloud-cap {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    line-height: 0;
    margin-bottom: -1px;
  }

  .cloud-cap__svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 74px;
  }
</style>
